" data-source=\"walksthrough\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Walks Through</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Energy Field (Square)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"19\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Energy_Field_Square_8987b7.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></span> Energy<br/><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Poison Gas\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poison_Gas_c58dd6.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></span> Poison</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Updates%2F13.40.54ea79\">13.40.54ea79</a><br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 01, 2024<br/>Summer Update 2024</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: <a href=\"#/wiki/Creatures\">Creatures</a></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-item-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20240604163352&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Angry_Sugar_Fairy_9766fb.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"creature-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see an angry sugar fairy.</div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"><li>Don't trample the beautiful sprinkles! That makes me angry!</li><li>No sweet sugar jewellery for you, intruder!</li><li>This is not the Candy Carnival! You should leave!</li></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<div class=\"webdesc\"><blockquote class=\"webdesc-text\"><p>Sugar fairies are delicate creatures consisting of sugar crystals, wearing colourful dresses made of marzipan and spun candy floss. They are seen as benevolent but prankful, bringing small amounts of delight to those who seek them out. Sugar fairies are typically a peaceful type of creature, preferring to spread positivity and joy around them. However, there are certain things that can make sugar fairies angry and upset. These include: Insults, disrespect, and rude behaviour towards them, desecration and destruction of sweet creations and delicacies as well as the presence of evil and malicious individuals or forces like Roshamuul nightmares.\nIf sugar fairies go underground, into the chocolate mines or gingerbread dungeons, they are often looking for ingredients or materials to use for their creations, which may be found only in these underground realms. These creations can vary greatly in size and complexity, depending on their purpose and desired effect. Intricate pieces of jewellery, figurines and ornaments are among them as well as charming and colourful dresses and apparel. You search for an elegant gown made entirely of candy floss, embroidered with sugary sprinkles? Tiny candy stars strung together on dainty chains to create a playful necklace? A chocolate coffee table or a soft peppermint cushion? The sugar fairies craft all of this artfully by hand and some of their creations can be bought at the Candy Carnival.</p></blockquote>\n<div class=\"webdesc-from\" style=\"float: right; margin: 0 2em 0 0;\">—Tibia Library</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-center wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"0\" hash=\"4312576280fe2ac417ea99da9a9e785b\" id=\"w-gallery-0\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Angry_Sugar_Fairy_Artwork-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:152px;\"><img alt=\"Official Creature Artwork\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Official \" height=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Angry_Sugar_Fairy_Artwork_1f35a4.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"Angry Sugar Fairy Artwork.jpg (458 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Official Creature Artwork</div></div></div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-abilities\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Abilities\">Abilities</span></h3>\n<div class=\"ability_list\">Unknown.</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mobile-hide\" id=\"w-creature-resistance-table\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Damage_Taken_From_Elements\">Damage Taken From Elements</span></h3>\n<div id=\"w-creature-resistance-d\">\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Physical\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Physical <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Bestiary Physical Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bestiary_Physical_Icon_Big_83da43.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:90.9091%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 9.0909%); display:inline-block;\">100%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" dat